  first | exact @GlobalTheory.LogBack.mem_smul_top_of_vanish | exact GlobalTheory.LogBack.mem_smul_top_of_vanish | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.LogBack.mem_smul_top_of_vanish <;> assumption)
